---
import ClientCaseStudyPage from "../../components/ClientCaseStudyPage.astro";
import CaseStudyImageSlot from "../../components/CaseStudyImageSlot.astro";
import { clientCaseStudyMedia } from "../../data/clientCaseStudyMedia";
const media = clientCaseStudyMedia.braces;
const longVideos = [
  { title: "Implant surgery", speaker: "Rebecca", src: "/videos/dental-preview/implant-surgery.mp4", poster: "/images/case-studies/balbriggan-braces-rebecca.webp" },
  { title: "Implant crowns and care", speaker: "Rebecca", src: "/videos/dental-preview/implant-care.mp4", poster: "/images/case-studies/long-implant-care-poster.jpg" },
  { title: "Aligner treatment", speaker: "James", src: "/videos/dental-preview/james-aligners.mp4", poster: "/images/case-studies/long-james-aligners-poster.jpg" },
  { title: "Retainers after orthodontic treatment", speaker: "James", src: "/videos/dental-preview/james-retainers.mp4", poster: "/images/case-studies/long-james-retainers-poster.jpg" },
];
const shortVideos = [
  { title: "The 22-hour aligner routine", src: "/videos/case-studies/balbriggan-braces.mp4", poster: "/images/case-studies/balbriggan-braces-aligner-video.webp" },
  { title: "Understanding a crossbite", src: "/videos/dental-preview/crossbite.mp4", poster: "/images/case-studies/balbriggan-braces-crossbite-video.webp" },
  { title: "Implant parts", src: "/videos/dental-preview/implant-parts.mp4", poster: "/images/case-studies/balbriggan-braces-rebecca.webp" },
  { title: "Orthodontic wax", src: "/videos/dental-preview/short-orthodontic-wax.mp4", poster: "/images/case-studies/short-orthodontic-wax-poster.jpg" },
  { title: "Interdental brushes", src: "/videos/dental-preview/short-interdental-brushes.mp4", poster: "/images/case-studies/short-interdental-brushes-poster.jpg" },
  { title: "Implant treatment in three stages", src: "/videos/dental-preview/short-implant-stages.mp4", poster: "/images/case-studies/short-implant-stages-poster.jpg" },
];
---
<ClientCaseStudyPage
  previewOnly={false}
  client="Balbriggan Braces"
  title="Dental video portfolio for clear patient education."
  metaTitle="Dental Video Production Portfolio | Balbriggan Braces | NextVision"
  description="See how NextVision planned and produced clinician-led educational videos for Balbriggan Braces, from detailed treatment explainers to concise social edits."
  intro="A dental video portfolio showing how clear planning, clinician-led explanations and thoughtful editing can help a practice answer common patient questions."
  service="Patient-education video production"
  location="Balbriggan, County Dublin"
  hero={media.hero}
  serviceHref="/corporate-video-production-dublin/"
  serviceLabel="Explore business video production"
>
  <section class="dental-video-section" aria-labelledby="dental-long-title">
    <h2 id="dental-long-title">Long-form patient education, explained in detail.</h2>
    <p>These four examples come from a collection of twelve longer videos. They give the clinical team room to explain orthodontic and implant topics clearly, in their own words.</p>
    <div class="dental-videos dental-videos--long">
      {longVideos.map((video) => (
        <figure>
          <video controls playsinline preload="none" poster={video.poster} aria-label={`${video.title}, presented by ${video.speaker}`}>
            <source src={video.src} type="video/mp4" />
          </video>
          <figcaption>{video.title} · presented by {video.speaker}</figcaption>
        </figure>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="dental-video-section" aria-labelledby="dental-short-title">
    <h2 id="dental-short-title">Short-form videos for social media.</h2>
    <p>These six examples come from sixteen finished short edits. Each answers one focused question with a clinician-led explanation, demonstration or graphic.</p>
    <div class="dental-videos dental-videos--short">
      {shortVideos.map((video) => (
        <figure>
          <video controls playsinline preload="none" poster={video.poster} aria-label={video.title}>
            <source src={video.src} type="video/mp4" />
          </video>
          <figcaption>{video.title} · short-form video</figcaption>
        </figure>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>
  <section id="the-project">
    <h2>One project, built around how patients watch</h2>
    <p>We shaped each video around a clear question, then matched the format to the amount of detail it needed. Longer explainers give patients a useful resource to return to. Short edits make one practical point at a time and are easier to share on social media.</p>
    <p>For the practice, that means a consistent set of videos that supports patient communication across its website and social channels. The aim was to make clinical knowledge approachable while keeping the clinicians and the care they provide at the centre.</p>
  </section>

  <div class="client-image-pair">
    <CaseStudyImageSlot image={media.detail} assetKey="braces:detail" />
    <CaseStudyImageSlot image={media.work} assetKey="braces:work" />
  </div>

  <section id="the-edit">
    <h2>Making the explanations visible</h2>
    <p>The short videos combine clinician-led explanations with dental models, close-ups and on-screen graphics. A timing graphic supports one demonstration, while a dental illustration helps make another explanation easier to follow.</p>
    <p>This is the connection between <a href="/corporate-video-production-dublin/">a longer business explanation</a> and <a href="/short-form-video-production-dublin/">a focused short edit</a>: the subject stays clear, while the amount of detail changes with the format.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="the-handover">
    <h2>A collection the practice can find its way around</h2>
    <p>We organised the finished videos into a clear library for the practice, with descriptive filenames that make each piece easy to find and reuse.</p>
    <p>For a similar project, start with the questions and the person best placed to explain each one. Our <a href="/blog/business-video-production-planning-dublin/">video planning guide</a> helps shape that list. This project also gives local businesses a concrete example of <a href="/videographer-balbriggan/">video production in Balbriggan</a>.</p>
  </section>
</ClientCaseStudyPage>

<style>
.dental-video-section { margin: 0 0 72px; }
.dental-videos { display:grid; gap:20px; margin-top:28px; }
.dental-videos--long { grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); }
.dental-videos--short { grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); }
.dental-videos figure { margin:0; min-width:0; }
.dental-videos video { display:block; width:100%; aspect-ratio:9/16; object-fit:contain; background:#07090b; border-radius:16px; }
.dental-videos--long video { aspect-ratio:16/9; }
.dental-videos figcaption { color:#d4dee5; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5; margin-top:12px; }
@media(max-width:650px){.dental-videos--long{grid-template-columns:1fr}.dental-videos--short{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}
</style>
